The icons of ROXIE

A red panda's face, drawn as shapes in the colours of share/roxie.css; our
own work, no photo.  roxie.svg is the drawing; the PNGs and
favicon.ico are rendered from the same shapes by scripts/make-icons.py,
which writes all of this directory but this file:

    python3 scripts/make-icons.py

    roxie.svg              the drawing, 512 by 512 (not served)
    favicon.ico            16, 32 and 48 as PNG entries
    apple-touch-icon.png   180, a full square
    roxie-<n>.png          16 32 48 64 128 180 192 256 512, round corners
    roxie-round-<n>.png    96 128 256 512, a circle with a ring

Hiawatha serves them from /var/www/roxie (deploy/hiawatha-roxie.urltoolkit);
ROXIE's pages name /favicon.ico and /apple-touch-icon.png; the stylesheet
puts /icons/roxie-48.png, 20 by 20, before the name in the head.
